"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.どうやったら早く\n覚えてもらえる?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.毎回同じ洋服を着て来て\nくれるとか特徴的な髪型\nだったりですね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/sun.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お名前も言ってくれると\n〜さんって呼べるので嬉しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/snow.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あたしも皆さんのこと\n早く覚えたい〜(´･ω･｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.好きな休日の過ごし方は?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.よっぽど疲れている時は\nﾓｶくんとまったりしてますが\n買い物"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/bag.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がｽｷです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/scissors.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.自分の名前とあだ名で\n呼ばれるのどっちが嬉しい?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.あーこの質問wどっちも\n嬉しいな〜 うっあん･\nゆうちゃんなど新しく\nあだ名作ってもらったり〜\n何でも嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/cafe.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、ﾒﾝﾊﾞｰからも友達からも\nゆったんなので、たまに\n優里って呼ばれると新鮮で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"br